                    Department of State, Central Files, 1967–69, PET 17–1 LIBYA. Confidential;
                    Priority. Repeated to London, Paris for OECD, Dhahran, Jidda, and Kuwait City.
                    Passed to the White House, DOD, CIA, USIA, NSA, COMAC, CINCSTRIKE, and USUN.</p>
